<!doctype html><html><body><template><style>#root{position:absolute;inset:0;color:#f8fafc;font-family:Avenir Next,Arial,sans-serif;pointer-events:none}.cue{position:absolute;left:78px;bottom:235px;width:924px;padding:19px 25px 21px;border-radius:22px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.92);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);box-shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.3);font-size:45px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.08;text-align:center;letter-spacing:-1px;opacity:0}.cue span{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#4FD1C5);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}</style><div id="root" data-composition-id="captions-es" data-duration="21.300" data-width="1080" data-height="1920"><div id="c1" class="cue"><span>El futuro no será del que</span></div><div id="c2" class="cue"><span>sepa más IA.</span></div><div id="c3" class="cue"><span>El futuro no será del que</span></div><div id="c4" class="cue"><span>sepa usar la inteligencia artificial.</span></div><div id="c5" class="cue"><span>Cuando todos tengamos acceso a respuestas</span></div><div id="c6" class="cue"><span>increíbles, saber responder dejará de ser</span></div><div id="c7" class="cue"><span>suficiente.</span></div><div id="c8" class="cue"><span>El verdadero valor será saber qué</span></div><div id="c9" class="cue"><span>problema merece ser resuelto.¿Qué problema de</span></div><div id="c10" class="cue"><span>tu negocio resolverías primero si mañana</span></div><div id="c11" class="cue"><span>tuvieras una IA perfecta?</span></div></div><script>const tl=gsap.timeline({paused:true});const cues=[["#c1",0.14,1.39],["#c2",1.39,2.1],["#c3",2.1,3.44],["#c4",3.44,5.02],["#c5",5.02,7.75],["#c6",8.05,10.07],["#c7",10.07,10.84],["#c8",10.84,13.03],["#c9",13.03,16.4],["#c10",16.4,19.11],["#c11",19.11,20.84]];cues.forEach(([id,a,b])=>{tl.fromTo(id,{opacity:0,y:14},{opacity:1,y:0,duration:.09,ease:'power1.out'},a).to(id,{opacity:0,y:-8,duration:.09,ease:'power1.in'},Math.max(a,b-.09))});window.__timelines=window.__timelines||{};window.__timelines['captions-es']=tl;</script></template></body></html>